### Get All Profiles
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

###

### Create New Profile
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo8",
  "password": "1234567",
  "mobile": "0999999456",
  "cardId": "1234567892345"
}

###

### Get profile by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/fc9d60b3-bba1-49b1-9a41-10d8d4231dc8

